    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iwe ipanga n'ihanga isolwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū lekanagi nayo ī yabūbi nī ya būkūng'ūnhi, nū wibeeleja, nū wilu, nū būsīgani bo mbika jose, ū bo kwisondagūla mu mbisīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bizagi gītī baana beleele, mukūmbūle no no no kūpandīka mabeele masoga, ayo gadūgije kūmugunanha kūkūla ū mu būpīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ng'wamalile kūbūloja ū wiza bo ng'wa Seeba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'washikile ū kūlī we, ūyo alī Iwe ipanga, īlo banhū balīdalahile, alīyo ū kūlī Mulungu isolwa, hangī lya mpango ntaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bing'we ī haha mulī gītī mawe mapanga, ayo gakūzengagwa kūbiza numba ībeejiwe mu kazengele ka ng'wa Moyo, ng'wingīle mu būgabīji wela kūlwa kūntūmamīla Mulungu mu katongeelelwe ka ng'wa Moyo, ako kazunīlījiwe mulī Yesu Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene nū mu shandīkwa gūlīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batogwa nalīng'wikūmbīlīja gītī bashimīzi na bageni, īpeelagi pyī ī mihayo ya kwikūmva kwa mīlī, īyo īkwilwishaga nang'holò jing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bizagi na kashimīzīle kawiza ū kū būtongi bo banhū abo batamanile Mulungu, ībize nūūlū balīmuhaya kībi gīkī mulī bīīti ba mihayo yabūbi, alīyo ū mu kūshibona ī shītwa shing'we ī shawiza balankumīlīje Mulungu, ū mu lūshikū lo kūsangwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Widohyakubatale bose",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, bizagi bidohya ū kū būtongeeji bo mbika jose ūbo būtūūlilwe na banhū, kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Seeba; ū ntemi nkūjagi īkī alī munhū ntaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a basugi a bangī bakūjagi, īkī balagīlilwe kūmala shiilī kūlwa bakenaagūji, na kūbakumīlīja a batūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū būtogwa bo ng'wa Mulungu būlī kwīta yawiza; ū mu gīko būkūhuumūjiwa ū būchilū chilū bo banhū abo batī na būmani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimīzagi gītī banhū abo balī mu wiyabī, alīyo ū wiyabī wing'we yaya ū kūbūtūmamīla kūbisa yabūbi; ū mu shīmīle shing'we iyoolechagi gīkī mulī batūmami ba ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūjagi pye a banhū, būtogagwi ū būdūgū, ng'ogohagi ū Mulungu, ū ntemi nkūjagi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būtūmami gītī umo būlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we batūmami bizagi bidohya mu logohano lose, ītī kū bawiza na balyehu dūhū, alīyo nū kū badaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gūlī mhayo gwa kūkumīlījiwa ūlū munhū wiyūmīlīja mu makoye aho akūluhiagwa mu kwiboneelwa, alīyo alīnsanya Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, ī gīsī būlīho wiza kī ū kwiyūmīlīja ūlū mulītūlwa mapī kūlwa nguno ya būkenaagūji? Alīyo ūlū ng'wiyūmīlīja ū mu būluhiwa ūbo mukūluhiagwa kūlwa nguno ya kwīta yawiza, ū mhayo gwenūyo gūlī gwa kūlūmbīlījiwa ū kūlī Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we ng'witanwa kūlwa mhayo gwenūyo, īkī nū Kilisito nang'hwe akaluha kūlwa nguno ying'we; ūmulekela būlolelo, mulondeele a kashimīzīle kakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei atīītile shibi shose shose, nūūlū būlomolomo būtafumile ū mu nomo gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasondagūlwa, alīyo atashokije mhayo gose gose gwa būsondagūji. Nūūlū aho waluhiagwa nahene atahayile mihayo ya kogohya, alīyo akiyinha kūlī we ū Namuji Ntūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wei ng'wenekīlī akashibūūcha ī shibi shise mu mīlī gokwe ha līntī, gīkī tūche ū mu shibi, alīyo ū mu būtūngīlīja tūbize bapanga; mukūpījiagwa mu nzīla ya magulagīje gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī kwandya ng'walī gītī ng'holo jijimīīlile; alīyo ī haha ng'wanshokelile ū Ndīīmi, ūyo hangī alī Nang'hani wa būpanga wing'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
